&lt;p&gt;Coinbase is building the future of institutional trading as part of the Everything Exchange, powering the systems that let the world&#39;s largest financial institutions trade across markets with speed, depth, and trust. As a Risk Architect on the Trading team, you&#39;ll design, build, and own the real-time risk engine at the heart of a unified trading platform: cross-asset user and portfolio risk evaluated in real time on the core trading system that serves our Retail, Prime, and wholesale brokerage customers. It&#39;s a rare chance to architect risk infrastructure from the ground up, with the ownership of a startup and the reach of Coinbase.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture of the real-time, cross-asset risk and margin engine: user and portfolio modeling, multifactor and borrow risk, and cross-portfolio evaluation at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design low-latency, high-throughput risk systems, keeping correctness and performance in step with a growing trading platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive reliability and performance, owning SLOs, observability, and incident response for risk-critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the technical bar through code, design reviews, and standards, and pay down the technical debt that matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the risk-architecture anchor for the team, mentoring engineers and reducing single-point-of-failure risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Product, Trading, Financing/Credit Risk, Security, and Compliance to turn technical vision into a roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
