&lt;h1&gt;Staff Software Engineer, Backend (Platform - Identity IDV)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Staff Software Engineer to own the multi-year technical vision and architecture for Coinbase&#39;s identity verification platform within &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Platform&lt;/a&gt;. This platform powers the decision engine, vendor orchestration, and infrastructure that determines whether an identity is genuine at global scale - processing approximately 700K verifications per month across Retail, Prime, and Institutional business lines. You&#39;ll define the identity trust layer that every Coinbase product will be built on, leading a three-year arc from platform consolidation through vendor-agnostic orchestration to self-serve scalability for the next billion users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end architecture and technical direction for Coinbase&#39;s IDV platform - the decision engine, vendor orchestration layer, and verification infrastructure that all business lines depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead platform consolidation by migrating all IDV onto a single decision-engine-driven platform, retiring 100+ legacy rules and fragmented paths, and eliminating single-vendor points of failure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build vendor-agnostic orchestration with automated, real-time routing and failover that selects the optimal vendor per request and dynamically balances fraud prevention (FAR) against user access (FRR/SCR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale the platform to support every new product, region, and verification modality (document, biometric, liveness) with self-serve configuration so any Coinbase team integrates IDV without a dependency request.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-team technical strategy and set the abstractions, APIs, and platform patterns that the broader Identity org builds on, influencing at the Staff level across multiple pods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of backend software engineering with a track record of deploying and operating large-scale production systems in regulated or fintech environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven technical leadership owning end-to-end design and delivery of complex, cross-team backend systems, including system design, architecture, API/data-model design, and production rollout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep distributed-systems expertise spanning scalability, reliability, API design, and high availability for Tier-0 services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level coding in Go (or equivalent systems language) with hands-on experience in gRPC/microservices, AWS, and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in identity, KYC, fraud infrastructure, vendor orchestration, or payments domains with the ability to turn ambiguous compliance and platform problems into actionable technical roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
