&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.” &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agent Verification builds systems that help Coinbase safely ship software in an AI-native development environment. The team develops automated code review, risk and policy evaluation, CI evidence, and merge controls that reduce routine manual work while preserving human judgment for higher-risk changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you will design and build reliable backend services and integrations across source control, CI/CD, policy systems, and developer workflows. You will lead the adoption of a consistent and observable merge path, partner with Security, Compliance, Infrastructure, and product engineering teams, and improve how software changes are reviewed and shipped across Coinbase.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced backend or platform engineer who has built distributed systems, developer infrastructure, CI/CD integrations, authorization or policy systems, or other high-reliability control planes. Experience with Go, GitHub integrations, AWS, Kubernetes, AI-assisted development, or policy-as-code is helpful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and delivery of Coinbase’s Unified Merge Gate, the system that determines whether a change can merge and explains what remains before it can proceed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate automated review findings, policy and risk assessments, CI results, identity and attestation evidence, and required human judgment into one merge decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Build reliable backend services and integrations across GitHub, CI and other Coinbase’s policy systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Migrate repositories from fragmented legacy controls to the Unified Merge Gate, with safe rollouts, observable decisions, and clear rollback paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security, Compliance, Infrastructure, Codeflow, ZTSC, and repository owners to turn control requirements into usable developer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the effect on human-review volume, time-to-merge, automated merge coverage, decision quality, and escaped defects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong backend and distributed-systems experience in Go or a comparable language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing APIs, durable state, failure recovery, observability, and safe rollout mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD, source-control integrations, developer infrastructure, or another high-consequence control plane.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong security and authorization judgment. The engineer must understand why a technically convenient path may weaken a production gate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of leading a cross-team technical project from design through migration and operational ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on AI fluency. The candidate should know how to use and evaluate AI-assisted engineering workflows rather than discuss them only at a conceptual level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
